THIRD-PARTY FONTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The typefaces in assets/fonts/ are the work of others and carry their own
licences, which travel with them and are unaffected by anything above:

  * Latin Modern Mono — GUST Font License (LPPL-based)
    assets/fonts/latin-modern-mono/LICENSE.txt
  * STIX Two Text — SIL Open Font License 1.1
    assets/fonts/stix-two-text/LICENSE.txt

Both permit commercial use and redistribution. The logo artwork carries its
glyphs as outlines rather than live text, so deployed files embed no font.

The full type library in lab/fonts/ is third-party material gathered for
evaluation. Each face remains under its own licence (predominantly the SIL
Open Font License and Apache 2.0); none of it is the Society's work.
